[00:18.27] These mist-covered mountains
[00:34.50] Are a home now for me
[00:41.08] But my home is in lowlands
[00:48.44] And always will be
[00:53.87] Someday, you'll return to
[01:01.66] Your valleys and your farms
[01:08.21] And you'll no longer burn
[01:13.20] To be brothers in arms
[01:15.73] Through these fields of destruction
[01:38.52] Baptisms of fire
[01:43.37] I've witnessed your suffering
[01:51.63] As the battle raged higher
[01:57.03] And though they did hurt me so bad
[02:03.65] In the fear and alarm
[02:08.74] You did not desert me
[02:14.70] My brothers in arms
[02:19.50] There's so many different worlds
[02:38.50] So many different suns
[02:44.67] And we have just one world
